From: SaaiOS <os@saaios>
Subject: synaptics td4150: since38 probe zero 0x45, hold idle 0x1b

since37 deferred 0x45 in zeroflash_init (fb_ready==0), but probe then
called zeroflash_retry_romboot_hdl because romboot_bytes_sent was still
false. Timeline: HDL at ~5.35s then panel_enabled at 5.867. Defer
printk was either skipped by that retry or lost in the IRQ storm.
Panel path then took 0x42-only because bytes had already gone out.

since37 also unmasked IRQ during 0x42 wait / after idle 0x1b
(need_*=0). gpio=0 + LEVEL + ONESHOT restored the ~8k/s livelock.

since38:
- Probe: no 0x45, no 0x42, no identify wait. Log defer 0x45 until panel
  and since38 probe. sensor_detection / IDENTIFY-24 stay.
- First panel_enabled with vdd on and lcd rst=1: full stock 0x45 then
  0x42 then wait IDENTIFY. Log panel up, run deferred 0x45.
- Idle 0x1b need_*=0: mask/hold IRQ (pre-since37). Silent ISR.
  IDENTIFY 0x10 already left RomBoot — do not mask, go to touch_init.
- No ENABLE_REPORT, do_polling, lcd_rst pulse, 97k retry, 0x30,
  touch_init in 0x04, completing 0x42/0x40 on 0x1b.

Applies after syna-tcm-romboot-panel-defer.patch.

